  "body": "Here’s your chance to secure a stunning brand-new architecturally designed family home in one of Orewa’s fast-growing coastal neighbourhoods. Positioned on a generous 426m² site with an impressive 249m² floor area, this thoughtfully designed residence combines modern style, functionality, and relaxed coastal living.\r\n\r\nDesigned with families and entertaining in mind, this substantial two-level home offers 5 spacious bedrooms, 3 beautifully appointed bathrooms, multiple living zones, and seamless indoor-outdoor flow.\r\n\r\nHome Features You'll Love\r\n• 5 generous bedrooms\r\n• 3 modern bathrooms including guest convenience downstairs\r\n• Spacious open-plan kitchen, dining & living area\r\n• Designer kitchen with separate scullery\r\n• Multiple living/lounge spaces for families of all sizes\r\n• Large double internal-access garage\r\n• Contemporary architectural design with striking street appeal\r\n• Elevated positioning capturing natural light and outlook\r\n• Indoor-outdoor flow to entertaining areas and decking\r\n• Low-maintenance landscaped grounds\r\n• Quality construction and modern finishes throughout\r\n\r\nThe floor plan has been cleverly designed to provide flexibility for growing families, work-from-home living, guests, or multi-generational living. The expansive main living area forms the heart of the home, while the upstairs layout creates excellent separation and privacy.\r\n\r\nOutside, the elevated site and modern landscaping create a clean, sophisticated coastal feel, perfectly complementing the contemporary weatherboard design and bold architectural features.\r\n\r\nThe Lifestyle\r\nLocated in sought-after Orewa, you’ll enjoy easy access to beautiful beaches, schools, cafés, shopping centres, motorway connections, and everything the Hibiscus Coast lifestyle has to offer.\r\n\r\nBrand-new quality homes of this scale and specification are becoming increasingly hard to secure in Orewa - making this an exceptional opportunity for families, investors, or buyers looking to secure their future in a premium coastal location.\r\n\r\nGet in touch today for a full information pack, specifications, and build details.",
